This repository contains code derived from the following projects, both
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

1. Open Bandit Pipeline (zr-obp), version 0.5.5
   https://github.com/st-tech/zr-obp
   Copyright 2020 Yuta Saito, Yusuke Narita, and ZOZO Technologies, Inc.

   - src/meta_slate.py is a modified copy of obp/ope/meta_slate.py
     (the estimator-input routing additionally carries the exposure
     decomposition nuisances).
   - src/estimators_slate.py reuses the slate-level bootstrap and the
     estimator method structure of obp/ope/estimators_slate.py.
   - src/utils.py: EpsilonGreedyEvaluationPolicy.pscores follows the
     epsilon-greedy propensity computation of obp/dataset/synthetic_slate.py.
   - src/dataset.py reuses the input validation and the enumeration /
     batching structure of calc_ground_truth_policy_value of
     obp/dataset/synthetic_slate.py.
   The remaining code imports and subclasses obp through its public API.

2. kdd2023-aips (Kiyohara et al., KDD 2023)
   https://github.com/aiueola/kdd2023-aips

   - src/aips.py is a port, with modifications, of the user-behavior tree
     and the subset propensity computation.
   - src/estimators_slate.py: SlateAdaptiveIPS is a port of the AIPS
     estimator.
   The deviations from the reference implementation are listed in the
   module docstring of src/aips.py.
